    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The oracle concerning the valley of vision.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In that day you looked to the weapons of the House of the Forest, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and you saw that the breaches of the city of David were many, and you collected the waters of the lower pool, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and you counted the houses of Jerusalem, and you broke down the houses to fortify the wall. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You made a reservoir between the two walls for the water of the old pool. But you did not look to him who did it, or have regard for him who planned it long ago.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of hosts, “Come, go to this steward, to Shebna, who is over the household, and say to him: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What have you to do here and whom have you here, that you have hewn here a tomb for yourself, you who hew a tomb on the height, and carve a habitation for yourself in the rock? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will hurl you away violently, O you strong man. He will seize firm hold on you, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and whirl you round and round, and throw you like a ball into a wide land; there you shall die, and there shall be your splendid chariots, you shame of your master's house. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will thrust you from your office, and you will be cast down from your station. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In that day I will call my servant Eliakim the son of Hilkiah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and I will clothe him with your robe, and will bind your girdle on him, and will commit your authority to his hand; and he shall be a father to the inhabitants of Jerusalem and to the house of Judah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.3.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 3.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And I will place on his shoulder the key of the house of David; he shall open, and none shall shut; and he shall shut, and none shall open. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will fasten him like a peg in a sure place, and he will become a throne of honor to his father's house. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they will hang on him the whole weight of his father's house, the offspring and issue, every small vessel, from the cups to all the flagons. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In that day, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of hosts, the peg that was fastened in a sure place will give way; and it will be cut down and fall, and the burden that was upon it will be cut off, for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has spoken.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
